# AI Customer Calling Agent - Project Requirements

**Student Name:** Amna Ahmed  
**Registration Number:** L1F25PACS0019

## 1. Project Objective
To develop a browser-based AI voice assistant that handles basic customer-service queries through simulated voice conversations.

## 2. Target Users
Customers who need quick answers to common business and order-related questions.

## 3. Core Features
1. Business hours inquiries.
2. Order status inquiries using sample order data.
3. Human-agent assistance requests.
4. FAQ-based responses using approved information.
5. Speech-to-text and text-to-speech where supported.
6. Conversation transcript and session history.
7. Fallback responses for unclear or unsupported queries.
8. Session logging using SQLite.

## 4. Technology Stack
- Frontend: React, HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: Python, FastAPI
- Database: SQLite
- Speech Processing: Browser speech recognition and speech synthesis
- AI: Rule-based intent detection initially, with optional LLM API integration
- Version Control: Git and GitHub

## 5. Project Limitations
- No real telephone calls or telephone network integration.
- No real customer information or live order-system integration.
- Order status will be retrieved from sample data.
- Human-agent transfer will be simulated within the application.
- Speech features will depend on browser support and permissions.

## 6. Success Criteria
The prototype should identify the three supported intents, return appropriate responses, handle unsupported queries safely, provide voice interaction where supported, and save session records in SQLite.
